  <HediffDef ParentName="EH_ElementalHeartHediffBase">
    <defName>EH_GlacialAscendant</defName>
    <label>Glacial Ascendant</label>
    <description>The evolved Water lineage commands Glacial Crescent, Frostwake Step, Crystal Vortex, Absolute Zero and Glacial Explosion. Preserves Still Water, Returning Tide and caster-owned Pressure. Explosion answers two or more nearby enemies with one impact, safe knockback, five seconds of icy-blue freezing and mild hypothermia. Grants 500% elemental movement, +50 mood, reinforced defense, recovery and Bestow: Water. Helmetless white/cyan regalia and an ice halo while transformed and drafted. The minimum comfortable temperature is lowered by 180 C.

Damage: this lineage multiplies the Melee damage stat by 2.2 (+120%). The shared 20% reduction makes an otherwise identical eligible physical melee packet 1.76 times its unascended value before armor and other modifiers. This is not a fixed skill-damage value: techniques scale from the current melee profile and use their own multipliers, marks and, where applicable, separate elemental hits. Do not apply the lineage multiplier a second time to the weapon profile.

Teamwork: elemental techniques can synchronize with nearby allied transformed Ascendants for brief shared bonuses and elemental support. Each participant has one six-second support cooldown.</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_WaterDefense" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_LightningRecovery">
        <sealAfterTicks>180</sealAfterTicks>
        <healPerSecond>2</healPerSecond>
      </li>
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_WaterAbilities" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_GlacialMastery" />
      <li Class="ElementalHearts.HediffCompProperties_GlacialExplosion" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>0.2</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Sight</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Hearing</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Breathing</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>BloodPumping</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>BloodFiltration</capacity>
            <offset>0.5</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Metabolism</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Talking</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Eating</capacity>
            <offset>0.25</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
        <painFactor>0</painFactor>
        <totalBleedFactor>0.25</totalBleedFactor>
        <naturalHealingFactor>6</naturalHealingFactor>
        <hungerRateFactor>0.6</hungerRateFactor>
        <restFallFactor>0.6</restFallFactor>
        <statFactors>
          <CarryingCapacity>10</CarryingCapacity>
          <MoveSpeed>5</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeDamageFactor>2.2</MeleeDamageFactor>
          <MeleeCooldownFactor>0.7142857</MeleeCooldownFactor>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>1.75</WorkSpeedGlobal>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>0.1</IncomingDamageFactor>
          <ImmunityGainSpeed>2</ImmunityGainSpeed>
          <JoyFallRateFactor>0.6</JoyFallRateFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <statOffsets>
          <MentalBreakThreshold>-0.25</MentalBreakThreshold>
          <MeleeHitChance>4</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>12</MeleeDodgeChance>

          <ComfyTemperatureMin>-180</ComfyTemperatureMin>
